 "و آن را حفظ کردیم"}}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَيْطَٰنٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَّجِيمٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "حَفِظَ", "count": 1, "first": "4:34", "audio": "audio/112f2f9b0461d4b94ad2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it guarded", "bs": "sačuvao je", "tr": "korudu", "fr": "il a gardé", "id": "dia telah menjaga", "ur": "اُس نے حفاظت کی", "bn": "সে রক্ষা করেছে", "fa": "نگهبانی کرد"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱحْفَظُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "5:89", "audio": "audio/f27aa3d3d9620bfbce74.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and (you all) guard!", "bs": "i čuvajte!", "tr": "ve koruyun!", "fr": "et gardez !", "id": "dan jagalah!", "ur": "اور حفاظت کرو!", "bn": "এবং তোমরা রক্ষা কর!", "fa": "و نگهبانی کنید!"}}, {"arabic": "وَنَحْفَظُ", "count": 1, "first": "12:65", "audio": "audio/a734b6149253bed07325.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "and we guard", "bs": "i čuvamo", "tr": "ve koruruz", "fr": "et nous gardons", "id": "dan kami menjaga", "ur": "اور ہم حفاظت کرتے ہیں", "bn": "এবং আমরা রক্ষা করি", "fa": "و نگهبانی می‌کنیم"}}, {"arabic": "يَحْفَظُونَهُۥ", "count": 1, "first": "13:11", "audio": "audio/b56a64f7c1afb1561a1f.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they guard him", "bs": "čuvaju ga", "tr": "onu korurlar", "fr": "ils le gardent", "id": "mereka menjaganya", "ur": "وہ اس کی حفاظت کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা তাকে রক্ষা করে", "fa": "او را نگهبانی می‌کنند"}}, {"arabic": "وَحَفِظْنَٰهَا", "count": 1, "first": "15:17", "audio": "audio/aef453a4cd591c394